  lines:
  - english: Earth is under attack. This station is our evacuation point.
    vietnamese: "Tr\xE1i \u0110\u1EA5t \u0111ang b\u1ECB qu\xE1i v\u1EADt x\xE2m
      l\u01B0\u1EE3c. Ga t\xE0u l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC3m t\u1EADp k\u1EBFt s\u01A1 t\xE1n."
  - english: Recover supplies from the twelve caches. The park and the river crossings
      are occupied.
    vietnamese: "Thu h\u1ED3i ti\u1EBFp t\u1EBF trong 12 r\u01B0\u01A1ng. C\xF4ng
      vi\xEAn v\xE0 c\xE1c c\u1EA7u qua s\xF4ng \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB qu\xE1i chi\u1EBFm."
